WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.820
Templates & settings: consent form texts in three languages, health questions, age rules and validity, and a library of ready forms.

2
00:00:11.374 --> 00:00:15.970
Add a suitable form from the "Form library" or create a "New form".

3
00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:22.230
Write the "Form text", "Confirmations" and "Health questions (yes / no)".

4
00:00:22.779 --> 00:00:28.570
Under "Age & validity", set the guardian age, minimum age and validity.

5
00:00:29.122 --> 00:00:36.350
In "Service words (automatic choice)", write the service words so the right form is chosen automatically.

6
00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:45.720
A signed form is locked; save changes with "Save as a new version" and tick "Earlier signers must sign again" if needed.
